{"version":1,"content":"<p>約旦軍方周一（26日）表示，為報復上周五（23日）有教堂遭武裝人員襲擊，造成9人死亡，他們派出空軍戰機，摧毁鄰國敘利亞境內的恐怖組織據點，又稱死傷都是襲擊組織的成員。</p><p>敘利亞民防機構證實，襲擊造成7人死亡，死者包括婦女及兒童。</p><p>（法新社）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:41:50.787894+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:26:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T08:18:49.536406+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:15.568969+00:00","content_hash":"64302ccb22996b91720d75a62917341c7cdcba83ca212e513c5673d9c44a93b0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}